SUMMARY:Wilcot Creek\, Serena Grundy\, Sunnybrook and Edwards Garden!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**MeetUp Point: Entrance is o
 ff Leslie Street. Turn left on Leslie to the parking lot 2 in Wilcot Creek
  Park.**\n(Don't follow the pin)\nJoin us for a 12 km urban hike that is c
 hallenging. Starting past Wilcot Parking lot 2\, we will be passing throug
 h sunnyside Park and Edwards Gardens.\nDon't forget to bring a lunch\, lot
 s of water and ensure arms and legs are covered as there are plenty of tic
 ks out there.
